---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Best Things To Do in Bend, Oregon';
const description = 'A local guide to the best things to do in Bend, Oregon, including hikes, lakes, breweries, coffee shops, family activities, scenic drives, camping, and outdoor adventures.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="guide-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Bend, Oregon Guide</p>
      <h1>Best Things To Do in Bend, Oregon</h1>
      <p class="hero-text">
        Bend is one of the best places in Oregon for outdoor adventure, local food, craft beer, coffee, scenic drives, rivers, lakes, and year-round exploring. Whether you are visiting for a weekend or planning a longer Central Oregon trip, this guide gives you a helpful starting point.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container intro-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>Start Here</h2>
        <p>
          Bend is easy to enjoy because so much is close together. You can hike in the morning, grab lunch downtown, visit a brewery in the afternoon, and watch the sunset near the river or mountains.
        </p>
        <p>
          This guide covers the main activities most people should consider first, especially if it is your first time visiting Bend.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="quick-box">
        <h3>Quick Picks</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Best first-time stop:</strong> Downtown Bend and Drake Park</li>
          <li><strong>Best easy nature outing:</strong> Deschutes River Trail</li>
          <li><strong>Best iconic hike:</strong> Smith Rock State Park</li>
          <li><strong>Best summer lake day:</strong> Sparks Lake or Elk Lake</li>
          <li><strong>Best local experience:</strong> Breweries, coffee shops, and food carts</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Top Things To Do in Bend</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Explore Downtown Bend</h3>
          <p>Downtown Bend is a great place to start. You will find restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, bars, and easy access to Drake Park and the Deschutes River.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Walk Through Drake Park</h3>
          <p>Drake Park is one of the most recognizable spots in Bend. It is scenic, easy to walk, and perfect for a relaxed afternoon near the river.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Hike Near Bend</h3>
          <p>Bend has easy access to desert trails, river trails, waterfall hikes, lava flows, and mountain views. Smith Rock, Tumalo Falls, and Pilot Butte are popular options.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Visit Smith Rock</h3>
          <p>Smith Rock State Park is one of the most dramatic landscapes near Bend. It is known for rock climbing, hiking, river views, and sunrise or sunset scenery.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Spend Time on the Deschutes River</h3>
          <p>The Deschutes River runs through Bend and gives the city much of its outdoor feel. You can walk, float, fish, paddle, or simply relax near the water.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Visit Bend Breweries</h3>
          <p>Bend is famous for craft beer. Many breweries have patios, food carts, family-friendly spaces, and casual outdoor seating.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Try Local Coffee Shops</h3>
          <p>Bend has a strong coffee scene with local roasters, cozy cafes, drive-thru stands, and great places to work or relax.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Take a Scenic Drive</h3>
          <p>The Cascade Lakes Highway is one of the best scenic drives near Bend, especially in summer and early fall.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Best Outdoor Activities in Bend</h2>

      <div class="feature-list">
        <div>
          <h3>Hiking</h3>
          <p>Hiking is one of the biggest reasons people visit Bend. You can find short city hikes, river walks, waterfall trails, high desert views, and mountain hikes within a short drive.</p>
          <p>Good starting points include Pilot Butte, Deschutes River Trail, Tumalo Falls, Smith Rock, Shevlin Park, and trails along the Cascade Lakes Highway.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>Lakes and Paddleboarding</h3>
          <p>In summer, the lakes near Bend are a major highlight. Sparks Lake, Elk Lake, Devils Lake, and Hosmer Lake are popular for paddleboarding, kayaking, relaxing, and photography.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>Fishing</h3>
          <p>Bend is a strong base for fishing in Central Oregon. The Deschutes River, nearby ponds, and mountain lakes offer options for both beginners and experienced anglers.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>Camping</h3>
          <p>Camping near Bend ranges from developed campgrounds to forest camping and lake camping. The best areas depend on the season, weather, road conditions, and how far you want to drive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Best Food and Drink Experiences</h2>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Breweries</h3>
          <p>Bend has a well-known craft beer scene, and breweries are part of the local culture. They are great for casual dinners, patios, groups, and relaxing after a hike.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Restaurants</h3>
          <p>Bend has everything from casual food carts and tacos to date-night restaurants, brunch spots, pizza, bakeries, and riverfront dining.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Coffee</h3>
          <p>Coffee shops are a big part of Bend’s daily rhythm. You will find local roasters, cozy cafes, and good places to start the day before heading outside.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Food Carts</h3>
          <p>Food cart pods are one of the easiest ways to eat casually in Bend. They are especially helpful for groups because everyone can choose something different.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Things To Do in Bend by Season</h2>
      <div class="season-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>Spring</h3>
          <p>Great for lower-elevation hikes, river walks, breweries, coffee shops, and exploring town before the busy summer season.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Summer</h3>
          <p>Best for lakes, paddleboarding, camping, floating the river, patios, scenic drives, and long days outside.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Fall</h3>
          <p>One of the best times for hiking, photography, cooler weather, fewer crowds, and colorful walks near the river.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Winter</h3>
          <p>Popular for skiing, snowboarding, snowshoeing, cozy restaurants, coffee shops, breweries, and easy town-based activities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Helpful Bend Guides</h2>
      <div class="link-grid">
        <a href="/bend/hiking/">Best Hikes Near Bend</a>
        <a href="/bend/restaurants/">Best Restaurants in Bend</a>
        <a href="/bend/coffee/">Best Coffee Shops in Bend</a>
        <a href="/bend/breweries/">Best Breweries in Bend</a>
        <a href="/bend/camping/">Camping Near Bend</a>
        <a href="/bend/fishing/">Fishing Near Bend</a>
        <a href="/bend/family-activities/">Family Activities in Bend</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container faq">
      <h2>FAQs About Things To Do in Bend</h2>

      <h3>What is Bend, Oregon best known for?</h3>
      <p>Bend is best known for outdoor recreation, hiking, the Deschutes River, craft breweries, mountain views, skiing, lakes, and easy access to Central Oregon scenery.</p>

      <h3>Is Bend good for a weekend trip?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Bend is a great weekend trip because you can combine hiking, restaurants, breweries, coffee shops, river walks, and scenic drives in just a few days.</p>

      <h3>What should I do first in Bend?</h3>
      <p>For a first visit, start with downtown Bend, Drake Park, the Deschutes River Trail, a local coffee shop, and one nearby hike like Pilot Butte or Smith Rock.</p>

      <h3>What are the best free things to do in Bend?</h3>
      <p>Some of the best free things to do include walking along the Deschutes River, visiting Drake Park, hiking Pilot Butte, exploring downtown, and enjoying scenic viewpoints.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .guide-hero {
    background: #f7f1e8;
    padding: 90px 0 70px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e7d8c5;
  }

  .container {
    width: min(1200px, 92%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #b35c1e;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: #213f32;
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 850px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #2d2d2d;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 70px 0;
  }

  .alt {
    background: #faf7f1;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.3rem);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: #213f32;
  }

  h3 {
    color: #213f32;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.35fr .9fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .quick-box,
  .card,
  .panel,
  .season-grid > div {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #eadcc9;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 26px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
  }

  .quick-box ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .quick-box li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .feature-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 30px;
    max-width: 920px;
  }

  .two-col,
  .season-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 26px;
  }

  .link-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 26px;
  }

  .link-grid a {
    display: block;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #eadcc9;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #213f32;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .link-grid a:hover {
    border-color: #b35c1e;
  }

  .faq {
    max-width: 920px;
  }

  .faq h3 {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .intro-grid,
    .two-col,
    .season-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .card-grid,
    .link-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .guide-hero {
      padding: 54px 0 44px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 46px 0;
    }

    .card-grid,
    .link-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
